'''Orthog''' was an [[Orthog's species|alien]] dock worker on the ''[[Colossus]]''.<ref name="Synara's Score">{{Resistance|Synara's Score}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Orthog first appeared in "[[The Recruit]]," the [[Star Wars Resistance: Complete Season One|Season One]] premiere of ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'', he was voiced by [[Fred Tatasciore]].<ref name="The Recruit" /> In the eighth episode "[[Synara's Score]]," he was voiced by [[Dee Bradley Baker]].<ref name="Synara's Score" />

